        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "35-7-15 The teacher is required to return to the Jefferson County School District and give service for a period of not less than two (2) years immediately following completion of sabbatical leave. In the case of one (1) semester sabbatical leave, the teacher is required to return to the Jefferson County School District and give service for a period of not less than one (1) year. A teacher returning from a paid sabbatical leave, not exceeding one academic year, will be returned to his/her former or comparable position at the same school.",
            "block_bbox": [
